%% VoxFlow — failure and escalation paths
flowchart LR
    Turn[Caller turn] --> Deadline{6 s turn deadline?}
    Deadline -- exceeded --> Esc1[Escalate + honest script]
    Deadline -- ok --> Tool{Tool result}
    Tool -- timeout --> Esc1
    Tool -- malformed --> Esc1
    Tool -- refused/unverified --> Esc2[Refuse or ask again]
    Tool -- valid --> Ground[Speak allow-listed fields only]
    Ground --> Close[Close or continue]
    Esc1 --> Ticket[Callback ticket / human queue]
    Esc2 --> Close
